OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 15 JUN
OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GKatie Derham presents live folk
OL,6,     Gmusic from the John McCusker Trio
OL,7,     Gin Edinburgh, and pianist
OL,8,     GBenjamin Grosvenor also performs
OL,9,     Gin the studio, ahead of playing
OL,10,     Gwith Aurora Orchestra.
